      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your pain is the direct result of the very end you expect to find.\nWe must see that the \"end\" gives life a sudden, beautiful clarity that you have only just reached.\nThe \"end\" is not a death, but a meaningful emergence.\nConsider how you might help the next generation to ensure the human touch is never lost.\nPerhaps the \"end\" is not death, but a meaningful emergence.\nYour life lived and died a human life.",
